cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the associated paper."
title: "CdS-Degradation-Modelling: data-informed modelling of cadmium sulfide photodegradation in oil paintings"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB pipeline for the data-informed calibration and long-term simulation
  of a non-local integrodifferential model of pigment photooxidation,
  applied to the conversion of yellow cadmium sulfide into white cadmium
  sulfate in oil paint. The pipeline preprocesses synchrotron S K-edge
  micro-XANES imaging data of artificially photoaged paint mock-ups,
  applies a monotonicity-preserving smoothing procedure, calibrates the
  three dimensionless model parameters through a hybrid global-local
  optimization strategy, and integrates the calibrated model up to 30 years
  to predict the growth of the sulfate alteration layer.
